Z||000000||REDHOTT88||11-21-2001||07:47 PM||||I just bought a bra (Wolf brand) from the Fiero Store. It looks terrible. I think the Fiero is a beautiful car, but the bra ruins it!  It covers up the front emblem and hides the nice nose lines. Not only that but this bra fits like crap!!  Oh, well.. I just became a Fiero owner and was bit by the "buy everything for it" bug!! Live and Learn.<BR>||||reg||1
