Z||000006||rogergarrison||11-22-2001||06:19 AM||||Im torn on the issue of bras (cars) They always do some kind of damage. Cloud the clearcoat, rub the edges. On Lisas car that used to have one, it rubbed holes thru the plastic on her hood. On the other hand, I get lots of gravy jobs repainting car noses, so use them if you want. On women, Im a small chest kind of guy, so bras are optional.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
